{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 04 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer：全局交互、层级窗口与高分辨率代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision Transformers</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_020_transformer-title\">Transformer</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">无递归的多头 self-attention encoder 与 masked self-/cross-attention decoder。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Recurrence-free multi-head self-attention encoder paired with a masked self- and cross-attention decoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">源 token 序列与右移后的目标 token 序列</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Source token sequence and right-shifted target token sequence</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">自回归目标 token 概率</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Autoregressive target token probabilities or contextualized sequence embeddings</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.3–4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2017/hash/3f5ee243547dee91fbd053c1c4a845aa-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_020_transformer')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_020_transformer')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Transformer original paper architecture figure, Figures 1 and 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/a07786789c3653dc89c0.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.3–4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_020_transformer\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_020_transformer')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_020_transformer\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">源 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tokens</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">词嵌入与位置编码相加后送入 encoder。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests source token sequence and right-shifted target token sequence and prepares initial tensor representations (Tokens).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"词嵌入与位置编码相加后送入 encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests source token sequence and right-shifted target token sequence and prepares initial tensor representations (Tokens).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"源 Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Tokens\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">源 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">词嵌入与位置编码相加后送入 encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests source token sequence and right-shifted target token sequence and prepares initial tensor representations (Tokens).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个源 token 以 Q/K/V 对全部源 token 做多头 self-attention。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Encoder MHA to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Encoder MHA\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder MHA\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Encoder MHA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个源 token 以 Q/K/V 对全部源 token 做多头 self-attention。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Encoder MHA to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐位置前馈网络配合 residual 与 LayerNorm。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder FFN within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Encoder FFN\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder FFN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Encoder FFN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐位置前馈网络配合 residual 与 LayerNorm。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder FFN within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"堆叠 encoder blocks 后形成供 decoder 查询的上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder Memory within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Encoder Memory\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder Memory\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Encoder Memory</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">堆叠 encoder blocks 后形成供 decoder 查询的上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder Memory within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练时输入右移真值；推理时输入已生成 token。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective Tokens within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"目标 Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"objective Tokens\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时输入右移真值；推理时输入已生成 token。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective Tokens within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"因果 mask 阻止目标 token 看到未来位置。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked MHA within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Masked MHA\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked MHA\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Masked MHA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">因果 mask 阻止目标 token 看到未来位置。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked MHA within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"decoder query 从 encoder memory 的 key/value 聚合源信息。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Cross-attention within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Cross-attention\" data-node-name-en=\"Cross-attention\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Cross-attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">decoder query 从 encoder memory 的 key/value 聚合源信息。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Cross-attention within the core encoder decoder attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨模态/跨序列融合后逐位置变换。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Decoder FFN to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Decoder FFN\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder FFN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Decoder FFN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨模态/跨序列融合后逐位置变换。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Decoder FFN to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测下一个目标 token 的词表分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces autoregressive target token probabilities or contextualized sequence embeddings via Linear + Softmax.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Linear + Softmax\" data-node-name-en=\"Linear + Softmax\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_020_transformer', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Linear + Softmax</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测下一个目标 token 的词表分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces autoregressive target token probabilities or contextualized sequence embeddings via Linear + Softmax.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Transformer Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 缩放点积注意力的核心前向式</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Scaled Dot-Product Multi-Head Self-Attention</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Transformer：核心公式 · 缩放点积注意力的核心前向式\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"20\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.4833pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.862331 -69.00913 160.176943 24.4833\" width=\"160.176943pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/x